<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P rates Finnish Export Credit, Israeli bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P rates Finnish Export Credit, Israeli bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Monday it has assigned an AA rating to Finnish Export Credit Ltd's 30 billion yen dual-currency bonds series 3 due February 1, 2001, which carries an annual yield of three percent.</p>
<p>The rating outlook is stable, the credit rating agency said in a statement.</p>
<p>S&amp;P also issued an A- rating to Israel's 20 billion yen three-percent samurai bonds series 1 due August 3, 2007. The rating outlook is stable, the agency said.</p>
</text>
